# Push finished work to main

When implementation work for this repo is complete and tests have passed:

1. Merge the working branch into `main` (or commit directly on `main` if already checked out).
2. `git push -u origin main` so production (Vercel) deploys from `main`. Do not force-push.
3. Do not leave finished, tested work only on a feature branch.

Prefer `main` as the deployment branch for Sunday Harmony site changes unless the user explicitly asks for a long-lived feature branch only.
